        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.solihull.gov.uk/business/licences/taxi-licensing/private-hire-and-hackney-carriage-driver-licence-guide"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            >Solihull Council — Private hire and hackney carriage driver
            licence guide</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        <strong>PHV Prep UK is an independent study aid.</strong> It is not
        affiliated with, authorised by, or endorsed by Solihull Metropolitan
        Borough Council or any licensing authority. Always check the council's
        official guidance for the latest application requirements and fees.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
